estions, Answered."]}]]}],["$","$L4",null,{"idPrefix":"service-candidate-sourcing","items":[{"question":"Do you source on job boards or LinkedIn only?","answer":"We use every channel that fits the role: LinkedIn Recruiter, job boards, niche communities, referral chains and your own ATS database. The channel mix is agreed per vacancy, and results are reported by source so budgets follow what works."},{"question":"How do you keep candidates engaged?","answer":"Every candidate receives a structured follow-up cadence with clear next steps, usually a mix of InMail, email and SMS over two weeks. Response patterns are tracked, and sequences are rewritten when reply rates fall below agreed thresholds."},{"question":"Is sourcing priced per role or per seat?","answer":"Sourcing hubs are priced as a fixed monthly retainer per dedicated researcher or screener, not per role or per placement. Costs stay predictable whether you run five vacancies or twenty, and capacity is adjusted with two to three weeks' notice."},{"question":"Will candidates know they are working with an offshore team?","answer":"Candidates interact under your brand only. Our researchers never mention Aakash AP, and all outreach runs through your email domains and messaging standards so the candidate experience stays consistent from first contact."},{"question":"Can you work to our screening rubric?","answer":"Yes. Your rubric is built into the hub's screening scripts during onboarding and calibrated against your recruiters' decisions in the first two weeks. Accuracy is reviewed monthly and scripts are updated as your standards evolve."}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs max-w-x